+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: all_nations.o_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   Projection: all_nations.o_year, sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(all_nations.volume) AS mkt_share                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[all_nations.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Decimal128(Some(0),38,4) END) AS sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(all_nations.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: all_nations                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |         Projection: date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Decimal128(Some(1),20,0) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume, n2.n_name AS nation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |           Inner Join: n1.n_regionkey = tpch.tpch.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |             Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate, n1.n_regionkey, n2.n_name                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |               Inner Join: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                 Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate, n1.n_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   Inner Join: tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                     Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate, tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                       Inner Join: tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey = tpch.tpch.customer.c_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                         Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                           Inner Join: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey = tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                             Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                               Inner Join: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_suppkey = tpch.tpch.supplier.s_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                                 Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_suppkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                                   Inner Join: tpch.tpch.part.p_partkey = tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                                     Projection: tpch.tpch.part.p_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                                       Filter: tpch.tpch.part.p_type = Utf8("ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                                         TableScan: tpch.tpch.part projection=[p_partkey, p_type], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.part.p_type = Utf8("ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                                     TableScan: tpch.tpch.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                                 TableScan: tpch.tpch.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                             Filter: tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate >= Date32("1995-01-01") AND tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate <= Date32("1996-12-31")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                               TableScan: tpch.tpch.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey, o_orderdate], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate >= Date32("1995-01-01"), tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate <= Date32("1996-12-31")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                         TableScan: tpch.tpch.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                       TableScan: tpch.tpch.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: tpch.tpch.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |             Projection: tpch.tpch.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               Filter: tpch.tpch.region.r_name = Utf8("AMERICA")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                 TableScan: tpch.tpch.region projection=[r_regionkey, r_name], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.region.r_name = Utf8("AMERICA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [o_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[o_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[o_year@0 as o_year, sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END)@1 / sum(all_nations.volume)@2 as mkt_share]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[o_year@0 as o_year], aggr=[sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(all_nations.volume)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([o_year@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[o_year@0 as o_year], aggr=[sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(all_nations.volume)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[date_part(YEAR, o_orderdate@2) as o_year, l_extendedprice@0 * (Some(1),20,0 - l_discount@1) as volume, n_name@3 as nation]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, on=[(n_regionkey@3, r_regionkey@0)], projection=[l_extendedprice@0, l_discount@1, o_orderdate@2, n_name@4]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
